{"created": "2026-09-12T19:39:17.016185+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-12T19:39:17.394303+00:00", "id": 22729229, "conceptrecid": "22729228", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22729229", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.22729228", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22729229", "metadata": {"title": "Nonclosed powers of a Zariski-closed subset of GL\u2083 in characteristic five", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22729229", "publication_date": "2026-09-13", "description": "<p>We construct a Zariski-closed subset \\(Y\\) of \\(\\mathrm{GL}_3(\\overline{\\mathbb F_5(u)})\\) containing the identity such that \\(Y^m\\) is not closed for every integer \\(m\\geq2\\). The same diagonal matrix lies in \\(\\overline{Y^m}\\setminus Y^m\\) for all such \\(m\\). The construction uses scalar multiples of an explicit family of upper triangular matrices. A polynomial curve proves nonclosedness, and a trace argument proves the reductivity of the ambient group. This gives a negative answer to Kourovka Problem 16.28(a). The counterexample and the ambient-group hypotheses are formalised in Lean 4.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Jayadevan, Achyuth", "affiliation": "Manipal Institute of Technology, MAHE", "orcid": "0009-0008-8745-4078"}], "keywords": ["Algebraic groups", "Zariski topology", "Kourovka Problem 16.28"], "version": "1.0.0", "references": ["E. I. Khukhro and V. D. Mazurov (eds.), Unsolved Problems in Group Theory: The Kourovka Notebook, 21st edition, revision 1 September 2026, Problem 16.28, arXiv:1401.0300.", "J. S. Milne, Algebraic Groups: The Theory of Group Schemes of Finite Type over a Field, Cambridge Studies in Advanced Mathematics 170, Cambridge University Press, 2017."], "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/Achxy/k-16-28", "code:programmingLanguage": [{"id": "lean", "title": {"en": "Lean"}}], "code:developmentStatus": {"id": "active", "title": {"en": "Active"}}}, "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "22729228"}}]}}, "title": "Nonclosed powers of a Zariski-closed subset of GL\u2083 in characteristic five", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22729229", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22729229", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22729229?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22729229", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22729229", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22729229", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22729229/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22729228", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22729228", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22729228", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22729228", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22729229/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22729229/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22729229/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22729229/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22729229:kourovka-16-28-paper.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22729229:kourovka-16-28-paper.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22729229:kourovka-16-28-paper.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22729229:kourovka-16-28-paper.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22729229:kourovka-16-28-paper.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22729229:kourovka-16-28-paper.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22729229/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22729229/media-files-arch